        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier",
        "text": "Oh, look at you, Patya, all high and mighty in that Shieldguard armor..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier",
        "text": "Does that pretty helmet of yours block your sight?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier",
        "text": "The maggots in the rations, bolts that snap like twigs, even duds!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier",
        "text": "Is this what they send us out to die with?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1978_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cold Soldier",
        "text": "If there are maggots in your rations, you eat them with the rations. If the weapons are hard to use, use your bare hands."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cold Soldier",
        "text": "We're soldiers. We fight and win. There are only two ends: Keep fighting, or die."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1976_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier",
        "text": "You're the one who's out of his mind!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1978_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cold Soldier",
        "text": "If you find that someone hasn't been doing his job, you report to your superior, not complain to me here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cold Soldier",
        "text": "I'm not the quartermaster\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
