        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier",
        "text": "S-Sir!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1977_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Officer",
        "text": "What did you find out, soldier?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Officer",
        "text": "Tell me the reason for your anger."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1976_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier",
        "text": "...The quality of our supplies and equipment on this operation is exceedingly poor."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier",
        "text": "The rations are insufficient, the cans damaged and filled with maggots..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier",
        "text": "Many of the bolts were not made of steel, but crude iron."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier",
        "text": "And the reserve Originium bombs are so weak that they're little more than glorified duds."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier",
        "text": "How are we supposed to proceed the operation with these?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1977_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Officer",
        "text": "Why did you enlist, soldier?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1976_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier",
        "text": "To..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1977_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Officer",
        "text": "Speak up."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1976_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier",
        "text": "To\u2014to prove myself! I want people to know my name\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier",
        "text": "Like they know yours!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1977_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Officer",
        "text": "They'll know your name when the Army sends your tags back to your mother, and she etches them on a white birch tree."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1976_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Angry Soldier",
        "text": "No, not like that..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1977_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Officer",
        "text": "There is little room for the individual to choose, when the collective is at war."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Officer",
        "text": "But..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Officer",
        "text": "Keep this hope in your heart, boy, and your 'discovery' too."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Officer",
        "text": "For the survival of Ursus and her people, there is only one option..."
    },
